    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/814d356c10c55e4070453d90b68676c0.avif?t=1744921794\" width=600 height=113 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/b904cb45f669002f08b6a28455d7ed1f.poster.avif?t=1744921794\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/b904cb45f669002f08b6a28455d7ed1f.webm?t=1744921794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/b904cb45f669002f08b6a28455d7ed1f.mp4?t=1744921794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With just a dash and a wall climb ability you can speed through worlds! Parkour your way to the end of the level using launch pads, doors &amp; more!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/6bd6091594c50982dd3c7f3bef23c989.avif?t=1744921794\" width=600 height=113 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore through four worlds and 40+ levels<br></li><li> A both <strong>casual</strong> yet <strong>action-packed</strong> experience<br></li><li> <strong>Map Editor:</strong> Make and play community-made maps using the map editor<br></li><li> <strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Race against your friends on official or community-made maps<br></li><li> <strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Climb up the leaderboards by gaining high scores<br></li><li> Unique scoring system that provides <strong>infinite replayability</strong><br></li><li> Move at Mach 10 (it's seriously very fun)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/814d356c10c55e4070453d90b68676c0.avif?t=1744921794\" width=600 height=113 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/b904cb45f669002f08b6a28455d7ed1f.poster.avif?t=1744921794\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/b904cb45f669002f08b6a28455d7ed1f.webm?t=1744921794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/b904cb45f669002f08b6a28455d7ed1f.mp4?t=1744921794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With just a dash and a wall climb ability you can speed through worlds! Parkour your way to the end of the level using launch pads, doors &amp; more!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861620/extras/6bd6091594c50982dd3c7f3bef23c989.avif?t=1744921794\" width=600 height=113 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore through four worlds and 40+ levels<br></li><li> A both <strong>casual</strong> yet <strong>action-packed</strong> experience<br></li><li> <strong>Map Editor:</strong> Make and play community-made maps using the map editor<br></li><li> <strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Race against your friends on official or community-made maps<br></li><li> <strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Climb up the leaderboards by gaining high scores<br></li><li> Unique scoring system that provides <strong>infinite replayability</strong><br></li><li> Move at Mach 10 (it's seriously very fun)</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Rigid is a fast-paced game all about sick parkour action at high speeds.",
